# The suites are run from a shell, never from a browser: nothing in here is a
# page or an asset. Reachable over http, tests/kernel-smoke.php would boot the
# kernel against a sandbox and run its seven hundred checks for whoever asked -
# seconds of cpu and a temp directory per request, and the sandbox path
# printed back. Denied the way app/ and features/ are; router.php mirrors it
# for php's development server.
Require all denied

Options -Indexes
